{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Ten Fingers 是一款讓兒童學習觸鍵打字的 App，透過 28 個關卡循序練習主行、上排、下排、大寫、標點與數字，適合 8 歲以上初學者。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-270.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>分階段掌握觸鍵打字</h2>\n<p>App 以 28 個關卡教授主行、上排、下排、大寫、標點與數字，首三個世界只計準確度，讓兒童按顏色提示用正確手指，之後才加入速度評分。畫面鍵盤會標示手指位置並統計失誤按鍵，建立個人複習；另有連續達標、紀錄、徽章、練習日曆及 45 秒競賽。支援三種世界、六種語言鍵盤、多名玩家進度與離線使用。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-209-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-210-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-211-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-212-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-213-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-214-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Ten Fingers: Learn to Type</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/ten-fingers-learn-to-type/id6816166714?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T12:43:56.933513+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":313,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T12:33:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T16:17:56.091869+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T12:37:28.159138+00:00","content_hash":"ef321f80e3626e61aaf322988814875612db69ac1bca13ff3827613d26b2e92f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}